[h2]Seven guaranteed boss drops that never dropped now drop[/h2]
[list]
[*]Several of this mod's guaranteed boss rewards were wired to an equipment slot the engine does not have, so they could never fall. That is fixed at the source: the Toxeus Rite formula now drops from the Enslaver of Souls and both Hunts, the Golden Bough from Charon's second form, Lethe's Draught from Mnemophage, and the Mask of Dread from Ephialtes, each at 100%.
[*]Twenty-five animal-relic sources (the wyrms, the brutes, the satyr archers, the Sileni) now actually roll their 7 to 10 percent instead of 0.
[*]To make room on those bosses without inventing slots the engine lacks, each gives up a potion drop. The reward is worth more than the potion.
[/list]
[h2]The Devourer of Blood[/h2]
[list]
[*]His soul channels are untouched from the last update while that fix is confirmed in play. His rant scroll and his own copy of the Rite were on the same dead slot; they stay parked until the soul question is settled. He never dropped them before either, so nothing is lost.
[/list]
[h2]Housekeeping[/h2]
[list]
[*]A new build check refuses any record wired to a slot the engine does not declare, so this class of bug cannot ship again.
[/list]
